; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
;  ASYMMETRIC GEAR
;  Pauldron right, bracer left, knuckle plate right. Nothing here is mirrored,
;  which is what stops a big symmetrical body from reading as a mannequin -
;  and it gives the eye a way to tell which arm is which mid-animation.
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

