; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
;  HEAD
;  Bald, so the skull shape itself is doing all the work - it gets a heavier
;  brow, a wider jaw and a beard to keep the profile from going egg-shaped.
;  Same depth-order rule as Kestrel: brow proud of skull, eyebrow proud of
;  brow, iris proud of eyeball, scar proud of everything.
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

